259
00:30:14,629 --> 00:30:15,228
© P @ rM ! NdeR M @ nkÖÖ

260
00:30:16,485 --> 00:30:18,840
Mr. Kipps . Mr. Daily .

261
00:30:20,365 --> 00:30:21,957
Glad you could make it . My pleasure .

262
00:30:22,045 --> 00:30:25,162
I 'm just bidding my son , Nicholas , goodnight .

263
00:30:26,245 --> 00:30:28,042
My condolences , Mr. Daily .

264
00:30:28,125 --> 00:30:29,604
It was a long while ago .

265
00:30:31,005 --> 00:30:34,043
There 's a place ready in there for my wife and me ,

266
00:30:34,126 --> 00:30:37,675
so we can all be together again one day . Come .

267
00:30:39,446 --> 00:30:42,438
I heard about the girl in the village .

268
00:30:42,526 --> 00:30:45,120
Terrible . Are you all right ?

269
00:30:46,486 --> 00:30:47,680
Yes .

270
00:30:49,166 --> 00:30:51,122
My wife doesn 't know

271
00:30:51,246 --> 00:30:54,683
and I 'd be grateful if you could avoid the subject .

272
00:30:55,207 --> 00:30:57,880
